WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:08.498
Okay, so llms.txt is a Markdown file listing the pages I want language models to read first.

2
00:00:08.498 --> 00:00:10.993
The proposal only requires an H1,

3
00:00:11.048 --> 00:00:14.393
and suggests a summary and linked sections with notes.

4
00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:20.790
Against it, my validator finds no errors in Cloudflare's file and twenty-one in Stripe's,

5
00:00:20.790 --> 00:00:23.537
which works like a documentation export.

6
00:00:23.537 --> 00:00:27.107
But the validator can't tell me whether anything fetches the file,

7
00:00:27.127 --> 00:00:31.765
and Ahrefs found ninety-seven percent of published files got no request in May.

8
00:00:31.765 --> 00:00:36.045
So I validate the structure and read my server logs,

9
00:00:36.045 --> 00:00:39.820
because a clean file and a fetched file are different facts.
